summary: 'Mid-session the founder asked for public hero pages for Paradigm, Gnomon and Warpline on GitHub Pages, quantifying their value, plus a reformatted way of teaching Paradigm with best practices. Product changes that surface while explaining the tools are wanted, not out of scope. Tone: clear and upfront that it is being built.'
